  "name": "Zoque",
  "variant": "Central Zoque (Copainalá)",
  "region": "Copainalá, Chiapas",
  "summary": "A Mixe-Zoquean language of northwestern Chiapas. Its speakers call it otetsame or ote; in Copainalá and Tecpatán, tsunitsame.",
